# bench fixture: 150 zero-argument rate functions on a one-species model.
# Purpose: put the ODE backend in the F x output-steps regime where
# per-step full-list function bookkeeping (updateFunctions) is visible.
# Generated once for bench/; deterministic, no randomness.
